      answer: 1,
      why: 'The rhetorical structure is the revolution: not "Aristotle is wrong because I disagree" but "here is a measurement anyone can repeat". Slowing the fall with an incline made time measurable at all — instrument design turning an unanswerable question into a graph. That manoeuvre, repeated a million times since, is what science is.',
