        'Universities were closed',
      ],
      answer: 1,
      why: 'Amateur gentlemen gave way to trained specialists: the PhD, the laboratory as a teaching factory, the journal as the unit of record, and the state as patron. The payoff was the second industrial revolution — synthetic dyes, fertilisers, electrical engineering — built by career scientists, the first time in history discovery became a growth industry.',
    },
